    "text": "A cylindrical plastic bottle of negligible mass is filled with <math><mn>310</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>m</mi><mi>l</mi></math> of water and left floating in a pond with still water. If pressed downward slightly and released, it starts performing simple harmonic motion at angular frequency <math><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>.</mo></math> If the radius of the bottle is <math><mn>2.5</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>c</mi><mi>m</mi></math> then <math><mi>&#969;</mi></math> is close to: <math><mo>(</mo></math> density of water <math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></math>"
