  "solution": {
    "text": "Let at equilibrium, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math> length of bottle is immerged in water:<br /><br />So, <math><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>g</mi></math> ..... <math><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math> [Equilibrium Condition]<br /><br />Now it is further pushed by distance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>A</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mi>g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi>m</mi><msup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=7.9</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow>